<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
        .container {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .otp { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #4A90E2; letter-spacing: 2px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Account Verification</h2>
        <p>Hello,</p>
        <p>Your OTP for account verification is: <span class="otp">{{otp}}</span></p>
        <p>This code will expire in 10 minutes. If you did not request this, please ignore this email.</p>
        <p>Best regards,<br>PickAm Team</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>